# One line ending everywhere. Xcode, the Swift toolchain and the Windows
# sessions used for engine work all cope with LF; mixing the two made every
# `git add` warn about fifteen files and every diff suspect.
* text=auto eol=lf

# Xcode's project file is generated, and merging it by hand is a bad idea.
# `project.yml` is the source of truth — see docs/PROJECT.md.
*.pbxproj -merge

*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.mlmodel binary
